# Betrayal at Beaucedine (WotG 19), a claim on Count Halphas. Status 1 (a GM): the trigger spawns the mob (8601),
# `claim` takes it, and the next trigger still answers UNUSUAL_PRESENCE (8603): the char is not engaged afterwards,
# so the NOW_IS_NOT_THE_TIME arm is not reached by a flow (a fake check pins it).
lists BeaucedineGlacierS/Regal_Pawprints_2/onTrigger BeaucedineGlacierS/Count_Halphas/onMobDeath BeaucedineGlacierS/onZoneIn/1 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/15 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/16 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/30
char zone=BeaucedineGlacierS pos=-15.066,-40.249,-217.276 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg BetrayalAtBeaucedine current
login
charvar Mission[5][18]Status 1
trigger Regal_Pawprints_2                  # spawn
claim #17334540
trigger Regal_Pawprints_2                  # claimed, not engaged: UNUSUAL_PRESENCE
